{"seq":1,"slug":"blanching-pasteurization","title":"漂烫与巴氏杀菌：温和热处理的科学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/thermal-processing/blanching-pasteurization","wordCount":2838,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"漂烫与巴氏杀菌-温和热处理的科学\">漂烫与巴氏杀菌：温和热处理的科学</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>漂烫（Blanching）与巴氏杀菌（Pasteurization）是食品热加工中两种最基础的温和热处理技术。两者共同特征是处理温度大多落在 60-100°C 区间（延长货架期的 ESL 强化巴氏处理可达 125-135°C），在实现特定加工目标的同时最大限度保留食品的营养与感官品质。漂烫主要用于果蔬加工前的酶灭活与组织预处理，巴氏杀菌则针对液态食品中的致病微生物灭活，两者的科学基础均建立在热动力学与微生物热致死动力学之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>漂烫与巴氏杀菌虽同属温和热处理，但二者的目标、对象与判定标准截然不同，其核心概念可拆解为以下要素：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>目标与对象的差异</strong>：漂烫以&quot;灭活内源酶、稳定组织结构&quot;为目标，对象是果蔬固体原料；巴氏杀菌以&quot;灭活致病微生物、保障安全&quot;为目标，对象是液态或已包装食品。目标不同，判定指标也不同——漂烫看酶残余活力，巴氏杀菌看目标菌存活数。</li>\n<li><strong>共同的动力学基础</strong>：两者都由一级热致死/灭活动力学支配——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 值刻画特定温度下杀灭 90% 所需时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 值刻画 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 值对温度的敏感性。工程设计的核心是&quot;等效处理量&quot;：不同温度-时间组合可获得相同的效果。</li>\n<li><strong>品质权衡原理</strong>：微生物的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 值（5-10°C）显著小于品质因子（维生素、风味）的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 值（25-40°C），因此提高温度、缩短时间可在等效杀菌前提下减少品质损失——这是所有温和热处理优化的理论依据。</li>\n<li><strong>边界与常见误解</strong>：漂烫不等于杀菌（其目标是酶而非微生物）；巴氏杀菌不等于灭菌（只灭活营养体致病菌，不保证灭活耐热芽孢，故成品需冷藏）。温度低也不意味着杀菌弱——较低温度可用延长时间补偿。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"漂烫的工艺原理\">漂烫的工艺原理</h2><h3 id=\"酶灭活机制\">酶灭活机制</h3><p>漂烫的首要目标是灭活果蔬中引起品质劣变的内源酶。这些酶在冷冻、干燥或罐藏等后续加工贮藏过程中若未被灭活，将持续催化不良反应：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>酶类</th>\n<th>催化反应</th>\n<th>品质劣变表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多酚氧化酶（PPO）</td>\n<td>酚类氧化</td>\n<td>褐变、色泽劣化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过氧化物酶（POD）</td>\n<td>过氧化反应</td>\n<td>异味、色变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脂肪氧合酶（LOX）</td>\n<td>不饱和脂肪酸氧化</td>\n<td>豆腥味、退色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>果胶甲酯酶（PME）</td>\n<td>果胶脱甲氧基</td>\n<td>质构软化（部分情况可利用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抗坏血酸氧化酶</td>\n<td>Vc 氧化</td>\n<td>营养损失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>酶的热灭活遵循一级动力学模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dA}{dt} = -k \\cdot A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 为残余酶活力，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 为灭活速率常数（受温度控制），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 为加热时间。速率常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 与温度的关系符合 Arrhenius 方程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = k_0 \\cdot e^{-E_a / RT}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>过氧化物酶（POD）因其极高的热稳定性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{100°C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">100°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可达数分钟），通常被选为漂烫充分性的指示酶——当 POD 被灭活 90% 以上时，其他氧化酶已被完全灭活。</p>\n<h3 id=\"漂烫对组织结构的影响\">漂烫对组织结构的影响</h3><p>漂烫过程中的热效应对植物组织产生多层面影响：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[热能输入] --&gt; B[细胞膜通透性增加]&#10;    A --&gt; C[果胶物质溶解]&#10;    A --&gt; D[淀粉部分糊化]&#10;    A --&gt; E[气体排出]&#10;    B --&gt; F[细胞液外渗]&#10;    C --&gt; G[组织软化]&#10;    D --&gt; H[质构改变]&#10;    E --&gt; I[组织收缩/密度增加]&#10;    F --&gt; J[可溶性营养流失]&#10;    G --&gt; K[有利于后续加工]&#10;    I --&gt; L[改善罐装/冻品外观]\">graph TD\n    A[热能输入] --&gt; B[细胞膜通透性增加]\n    A --&gt; C[果胶物质溶解]\n    A --&gt; D[淀粉部分糊化]\n    A --&gt; E[气体排出]\n    B --&gt; F[细胞液外渗]\n    C --&gt; G[组织软化]\n    D --&gt; H[质构改变]\n    E --&gt; I[组织收缩/密度增加]\n    F --&gt; J[可溶性营养流失]\n    G --&gt; K[有利于后续加工]\n    I --&gt; L[改善罐装/冻品外观]</pre><p>适度漂烫使组织脱气（排出细胞间隙气体），这对后续罐藏特别重要——减少罐头顶隙氧含量、防止浮果现象、改善传热均匀性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"漂烫工艺方式\">漂烫工艺方式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工艺方式</th>\n<th>介质</th>\n<th>温度范围</th>\n<th>典型时间</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>热水漂烫</td>\n<td>水</td>\n<td>85-100°C</td>\n<td>1-10 min</td>\n<td>传热均匀、设备简单</td>\n<td>可溶性物质流失大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蒸汽漂烫</td>\n<td>饱和蒸汽</td>\n<td>100°C</td>\n<td>1-5 min</td>\n<td>水溶性营养保留好</td>\n<td>加热不均匀、表面过热</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微波漂烫</td>\n<td>电磁波</td>\n<td>体积加热</td>\n<td>30s-3 min</td>\n<td>快速、营养保留最佳</td>\n<td>设备昂贵、均匀性差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧姆漂烫</td>\n<td>电流</td>\n<td>70-95°C</td>\n<td>30s-2 min</td>\n<td>体积加热、快速</td>\n<td>需导电介质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>红外漂烫</td>\n<td>红外辐射</td>\n<td>表面 120-150°C</td>\n<td>30s-2 min</td>\n<td>无废水、连续化</td>\n<td>仅适合薄层物料</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工业中最常用的是连续式热水漂烫机（旋转滚筒式或带式输送），处理量可达 5-20 t/h。蒸汽漂烫则以 IQB（Individual Quick Blanching）技术为代表，通过薄层快速蒸汽加热结合保持段，实现精确的热处理量控制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"巴氏杀菌的科学基础\">巴氏杀菌的科学基础</h2><h3 id=\"微生物热致死动力学\">微生物热致死动力学</h3><p>巴氏杀菌的设计基础是微生物的热致死动力学。微生物群体的热致死遵循对数递减规律：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log\\frac{N_t}{N_0} = -\\frac{t}{D_T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1281em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为初始菌数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为加热 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 时间后的存活菌数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为在温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 下的十进制递减时间（杀灭 90% 所需时间）。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 值随温度升高呈对数下降，其温度敏感性用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 值表征：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mi>z</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log\\frac{D_{T_1}}{D_{T_2}} = \\frac{T_2 - T_1}{z}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2964em;vertical-align:-0.9361em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9361em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>巴氏杀菌的目标微生物因食品特性而异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>食品类型</th>\n<th>目标微生物</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 参考值</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>牛奶</td>\n<td>Coxiella burnetii</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mn>72</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{72°C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">72°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 15s</td>\n<td>5.5°C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>果汁（pH&lt;4.6）</td>\n<td>霉菌/酵母孢子</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mn>65</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{65°C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">65°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 0.5-3 min</td>\n<td>5-8°C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>啤酒</td>\n<td>乳酸菌/野生酵母</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{60°C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">60°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 1-5 min</td>\n<td>5-7°C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蛋液</td>\n<td>Salmonella</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{60°C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">60°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 2.5 min</td>\n<td>4.5°C</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"巴氏杀菌工艺分类\">巴氏杀菌工艺分类</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[巴氏杀菌] --&gt; B[低温长时 LTLT]&#10;    A --&gt; C[高温短时 HTST]&#10;    A --&gt; D[超巴氏 ESL]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;63°C / 30 min&lt;br/&gt;小规模乳制品&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;72°C / 15s&lt;br/&gt;鲜奶标准工艺&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;85°C / 2s&lt;br/&gt;果汁常用&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;125-135°C / 0.5-2s&lt;br/&gt;延长货架期&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[巴氏杀菌] --&gt; B[低温长时 LTLT]\n    A --&gt; C[高温短时 HTST]\n    A --&gt; D[超巴氏 ESL]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"63°C / 30 min&lt;br/&gt;小规模乳制品\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"72°C / 15s&lt;br/&gt;鲜奶标准工艺\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"85°C / 2s&lt;br/&gt;果汁常用\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"125-135°C / 0.5-2s&lt;br/&gt;延长货架期\"]</pre><p>HTST（High Temperature Short Time）是现代巴氏杀菌的主流工艺。其原理基于一个关键热力学事实：微生物灭活的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 值（约 5-10°C）小于营养/品质因子的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 值（约 25-40°C），即温度升高对杀菌效果的提升远大于对品质的破坏。因此，提高温度、缩短时间可在等效杀菌的前提下减少品质损失。</p>\n<h3 id=\"板式热交换器系统\">板式热交换器系统</h3><p>HTST 巴氏杀菌系统的核心设备是板式热交换器（PHE），其典型流程包含：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[原料储罐] --&gt; B[平衡罐]&#10;    B --&gt; C[再生段预热]&#10;    C --&gt; D[加热段]&#10;    D --&gt; E[保持管]&#10;    E --&gt; F[流量转向阀]&#10;    F --&gt;|达标| G[再生段冷却]&#10;    F --&gt;|未达标| B&#10;    G --&gt; H[冷却段]&#10;    H --&gt; I[灌装]\">graph TD\n    A[原料储罐] --&gt; B[平衡罐]\n    B --&gt; C[再生段预热]\n    C --&gt; D[加热段]\n    D --&gt; E[保持管]\n    E --&gt; F[流量转向阀]\n    F --&gt;|达标| G[再生段冷却]\n    F --&gt;|未达标| B\n    G --&gt; H[冷却段]\n    H --&gt; I[灌装]</pre><p>再生段（Regeneration Section）是板式杀菌系统的关键节能设计：已杀菌的热产品与冷原料在薄板两侧逆流换热，热回收率可达 90-95%，显著降低能耗。</p>\n<p><strong>关键工艺参数控制：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>控制要求</th>\n<th>监测手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>杀菌温度</td>\n<td>±0.5°C 精度</td>\n<td>热电偶 + PLC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保持时间</td>\n<td>依据流速与管长计算</td>\n<td>流量计 + 管道设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流量</td>\n<td>不超过设计最大值</td>\n<td>磁力流量计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压差</td>\n<td>杀菌侧 &gt; 原料侧</td>\n<td>差压传感器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转向阀温度</td>\n<td>低于设定值自动回流</td>\n<td>温度联锁</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"漂烫与巴氏杀菌的品质影响\">漂烫与巴氏杀菌的品质影响</h2><h3 id=\"营养成分变化\">营养成分变化</h3><p>温和热处理对营养成分的影响取决于热敏感性与浸出损失两个因素：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>营养成分</th>\n<th>热敏感性</th>\n<th>主要损失机制</th>\n<th>典型保留率（HTST）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>维生素 C</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>氧化降解 + 浸出</td>\n<td>85-95%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维生素 B₁</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>热降解</td>\n<td>90-95%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>叶酸</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>氧化降解</td>\n<td>80-90%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蛋白质</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>变性（非损失）</td>\n<td>&gt;98%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>矿物质</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>仅浸出</td>\n<td>&gt;95%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>酚类物质</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>氧化/聚合</td>\n<td>85-95%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"工艺优化策略\">工艺优化策略</h3><p>最小化品质损失的策略核心是&quot;等效杀菌，差异品质&quot;原则——在满足安全要求的前提下，选择对品质因子破坏最小的时间-温度组合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>提高温度、缩短时间</strong>：利用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mtext>杀菌</mtext></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mtext>品质</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_{杀菌} &lt; z_{品质}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">杀菌</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">品质</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的差异</li>\n<li><strong>快速加热/冷却</strong>：减少 Come-up 和 Come-down 时间段的累积热损伤</li>\n<li><strong>连续化流动处理</strong>：相比批式静态加热，传热更均匀、停留时间分布更窄</li>\n<li><strong>低氧环境</strong>：减少热处理期间的氧化降解</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"新型漂烫与巴氏杀菌技术\">新型漂烫与巴氏杀菌技术</h2><h3 id=\"热辅助技术组合\">热辅助技术组合</h3><p>近年来，多种热辅助技术被开发以进一步优化温和热处理的效果：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组合技术</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>热 + 超声波</td>\n<td>声空化增强传热/传质</td>\n<td>缩短处理时间 30-50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热 + 温和高压</td>\n<td>压力降低酶/微生物热稳定性</td>\n<td>降低所需温度 5-15°C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热 + 射频/微波</td>\n<td>体积加热消除温度梯度</td>\n<td>均匀性提升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热 + CO₂ 注入</td>\n<td>碳酸化降低 pH 协同杀菌</td>\n<td>可降温 5-10°C</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"精准漂烫技术发展\">精准漂烫技术发展</h3><p>新一代漂烫设备强调&quot;精准&quot;——根据单个果蔬颗粒的大小、初温、成熟度差异，自动调整漂烫参数：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>视觉分级 + 自适应漂烫</strong>：机器视觉系统实时测量物料尺寸，动态调整传送速度</li>\n<li><strong>TILO（Thermally Integrated Low Oxygen）漂烫</strong>：在低氧环境下执行蒸汽漂烫，将 Vc 保留率提高至 95%+</li>\n<li><strong>两段式漂烫</strong>：先低温（60-70°C）激活 PME 强化果胶网络，再高温（95°C）灭酶，兼得硬度保持与酶灭活</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"工业应用案例\">工业应用案例</h2><h3 id=\"案例一-速冻蔬菜生产线漂烫系统\">案例一：速冻蔬菜生产线漂烫系统</h3><p>某年产 5 万吨速冻蔬菜工厂的漂烫段配置：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>设备</strong>：连续带式蒸汽漂烫机（有效加热长度 12m）+ IQB 保持段（6m）</li>\n<li><strong>物料</strong>：青豆（直径 7-10mm）</li>\n<li><strong>工艺</strong>：蒸汽温度 100°C，带速 3m/min，总停留时间 2.5 min</li>\n<li><strong>验证指标</strong>：POD 残余活力 &lt;5%，Vc 保留率 &gt;90%，色差 ΔE &lt;3</li>\n<li><strong>产能</strong>：8 t/h，热回收利用蒸汽冷凝水预热原料</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"案例二-鲜奶-htst-巴氏杀菌\">案例二：鲜奶 HTST 巴氏杀菌</h3><p>某日处理 200 吨鲜奶的 HTST 系统：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>设备</strong>：APV 板式热交换器（316L 不锈钢板片，波纹角 60°）</li>\n<li><strong>工艺</strong>：72.5°C / 15.5s（含安全余量），再生率 94%</li>\n<li><strong>CIP 清洗</strong>：碱洗（2% NaOH, 75°C, 20min）→ 酸洗（1% HNO₃, 65°C, 15min）→ 热水冲洗</li>\n<li><strong>在线监测</strong>：双温度传感器互校验、电导率检测清洗效果、ATP 快速微生物验证</li>\n<li><strong>产品指标</strong>：菌落总数 &lt;1000 CFU/mL，大肠菌群未检出，ALP 阴性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"质量控制与法规要求\">质量控制与法规要求</h2><h3 id=\"关键控制点\">关键控制点</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CCP</th>\n<th>危害</th>\n<th>关键限值</th>\n<th>监测方法</th>\n<th>纠偏措施</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>漂烫温度/时间</td>\n<td>酶残余活性</td>\n<td>POD 灭活 &gt;90%</td>\n<td>温度记录 + 终产品酶活测试</td>\n<td>延长时间/升温</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>巴杀温度</td>\n<td>致病菌存活</td>\n<td>≥72°C</td>\n<td>连续温度记录仪</td>\n<td>转向阀回流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保持时间</td>\n<td>杀菌不足</td>\n<td>≥15s（牛奶）</td>\n<td>流量记录</td>\n<td>降低流量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷却温度</td>\n<td>嗜热菌生长</td>\n<td>≤4°C（30min内）</td>\n<td>产品出口温度</td>\n<td>减慢流速</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"主要法规标准\">主要法规标准</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>中国</strong>：GB 19645《巴氏杀菌乳》、GB 8950《罐头食品生产卫生规范》</li>\n<li><strong>美国</strong>：21 CFR 113（热加工密封容器低酸食品）、PMO（Pasteurized Milk Ordinance）</li>\n<li><strong>欧盟</strong>：Regulation (EC) No 853/2004（动物源性食品卫生规则）</li>\n<li><strong>国际</strong>：Codex Alimentarius CAC/RCP 40（果蔬加工卫生操作规范）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>漂烫与巴氏杀菌作为温和热处理的两大支柱技术，其科学基础在于对酶和微生物热致死动力学的精确理解与工程化应用。核心设计原则是利用杀菌/灭酶因子与品质因子之间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 值差异，通过优化时间-温度组合实现&quot;安全充分、品质最优&quot;。随着精准控制技术与热辅助技术的发展，温和热处理正朝着更精确、更节能、品质保留更好的方向持续演进。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"漂烫与巴氏杀菌：温和热处理的科学","id":"漂烫与巴氏杀菌-温和热处理的科学"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"漂烫的工艺原理","id":"漂烫的工艺原理"},{"level":3,"text":"酶灭活机制","id":"酶灭活机制"},{"level":3,"text":"漂烫对组织结构的影响","id":"漂烫对组织结构的影响"},{"level":3,"text":"漂烫工艺方式","id":"漂烫工艺方式"},{"level":2,"text":"巴氏杀菌的科学基础","id":"巴氏杀菌的科学基础"},{"level":3,"text":"微生物热致死动力学","id":"微生物热致死动力学"},{"level":3,"text":"巴氏杀菌工艺分类","id":"巴氏杀菌工艺分类"},{"level":3,"text":"板式热交换器系统","id":"板式热交换器系统"},{"level":2,"text":"漂烫与巴氏杀菌的品质影响","id":"漂烫与巴氏杀菌的品质影响"},{"level":3,"text":"营养成分变化","id":"营养成分变化"},{"level":3,"text":"工艺优化策略","id":"工艺优化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"新型漂烫与巴氏杀菌技术","id":"新型漂烫与巴氏杀菌技术"},{"level":3,"text":"热辅助技术组合","id":"热辅助技术组合"},{"level":3,"text":"精准漂烫技术发展","id":"精准漂烫技术发展"},{"level":2,"text":"工业应用案例","id":"工业应用案例"},{"level":3,"text":"案例一：速冻蔬菜生产线漂烫系统","id":"案例一-速冻蔬菜生产线漂烫系统"},{"level":3,"text":"案例二：鲜奶 HTST 巴氏杀菌","id":"案例二-鲜奶-htst-巴氏杀菌"},{"level":2,"text":"质量控制与法规要求","id":"质量控制与法规要求"},{"level":3,"text":"关键控制点","id":"关键控制点"},{"level":3,"text":"主要法规标准","id":"主要法规标准"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"商业灭菌与罐藏：强力热处理的工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/thermal-processing/sterilization-canning"}}